1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire
Knight of the Ribbon

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Knight of the Ribbon,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Twentieth Episode
The Shadow Eaters
Monster Kagera

15
00:02:09,380 --> 00:02:12,386
And what song would you like to hear next?

16
00:02:18,144 --> 00:02:20,993
Where's everyone going?

17
00:02:21,180 --> 00:02:22,400
Hey, Tink!

18
00:02:22,490 --> 00:02:25,019
We're going to hear a story from the old man in the forest!

19
00:02:25,220 --> 00:02:26,413
Come with us, Tink!

20
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:27,919
Wow, awesome!

21
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:29,860
I love stories.

22
00:02:29,943 --> 00:02:31,090
I'm coming!

23
00:02:33,560 --> 00:02:37,046
Oh, right. Don't I have sheep-herding duty?

24
00:02:38,413 --> 00:02:41,030
Alright, I just have to play, right?

25
00:02:49,210 --> 00:02:50,820
Don't glare at me like that!

26
00:03:14,190 --> 00:03:17,133
Now then, what story should I tell you today?

27
00:03:17,490 --> 00:03:19,073
I want a pirate story!

28
00:03:19,440 --> 00:03:20,899
That's boring!

29
00:03:21,260 --> 00:03:23,660
I want a story about a princess!

30
00:03:24,784 --> 00:03:26,400
Wait for me!

31
00:03:27,050 --> 00:03:28,620
Tell me a story too...

32
00:03:30,490 --> 00:03:33,280
Now, now, no need to rush.

33
00:03:34,090 --> 00:03:37,026
But I have to tend the sheep!

34
00:03:37,050 --> 00:03:39,193
I have to go back right after the story.

35
00:03:39,217 --> 00:03:42,880
We're running out of time, so hurry up and get started!

36
00:03:43,075 --> 00:03:45,733
Tink, is it okay to ditch your work?

37
00:03:46,000 --> 00:03:47,259
Yeah, just for a little bit.

38
00:03:48,270 --> 00:03:50,860
Alright, now that everyone's here, shall we begin?

39
00:03:52,870 --> 00:03:56,220
Right, today I'll tell you the story of how shadows came to be.

40
00:03:56,719 --> 00:03:58,161
Shadows?

41
00:03:58,186 --> 00:03:59,271
That's right.

42
00:03:59,295 --> 00:04:03,704
Once upon a time, back when few living creatures walked the earth...

43
00:04:03,728 --> 00:04:09,600
humans, horses, rabbits, every living thing was terribly lonely.

44
00:04:10,180 --> 00:04:15,920
Everyone was all alone without any friends, so they did nothing but cry.

45
00:04:16,035 --> 00:04:20,159
Because of that, they were always weak and falling ill.

46
00:04:20,373 --> 00:04:27,073
Worried by this, God thought that making them good friends would cure their sickness.

47
00:04:27,385 --> 00:04:31,740
He spent two seconds thinking of a good idea—and finally got one!

48
00:04:32,199 --> 00:04:35,857
The child who received a friend danced for joy,

49
00:04:35,881 --> 00:04:39,819
but someone greedy stole that friend away.

50
00:04:39,880 --> 00:04:43,340
Troubled, God thought for three whole seconds this time.

51
00:04:43,545 --> 00:04:47,353
Slapping his knee, an idea struck him!

52
00:04:47,675 --> 00:04:51,040
And he attached the friend directly to the child's feet.

53
00:04:51,760 --> 00:04:55,817
From then on, no one could steal it away,

54
00:04:55,841 --> 00:04:59,179
and it became an inseparable friend to everyone.

55
00:04:59,790 --> 00:05:01,360
That's how shadows came to be.

56
00:05:01,940 --> 00:05:05,400
It's the friend that stays closest to us.

57
00:05:21,946 --> 00:05:22,386
Wait...

58
00:05:22,720 --> 00:05:23,260
Oh no!

59
00:05:23,410 --> 00:05:25,240
There's a stray sheep over there.

60
00:05:27,190 --> 00:05:28,706
Honestly, you're hopeless.

61
00:05:28,835 --> 00:05:31,619
That little guy gets lost so easily.

62
00:05:33,730 --> 00:05:35,060
Wh-What is that?

63
00:05:45,610 --> 00:05:46,940
Look, a monster!

64
00:05:56,385 --> 00:05:57,853
It ate a sheep's shadow!

65
00:05:58,960 --> 00:05:59,960
That's impossible!

66
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:11,106
It's a shadow-eating monster!

67
00:06:11,485 --> 00:06:12,705
Everyone, run!

68
00:06:12,940 --> 00:06:14,920
Help!

69
00:06:17,685 --> 00:06:18,798
Oh no!

70
00:06:23,146 --> 00:06:24,146
It's no use!

71
00:06:24,170 --> 00:06:25,080
They found us!

72
00:06:25,130 --> 00:06:26,153
Run for it, Tink!

73
00:06:42,549 --> 00:06:43,056
Tink!

74
00:06:43,080 --> 00:06:43,899
Hurry, run!

75
00:06:51,020 --> 00:06:52,626
There's a house over there!

76
00:06:57,100 --> 00:06:57,680
Listen to me, okay?

77
00:06:57,905 --> 00:06:59,880
Don't make a sound and stay quiet.

78
00:06:59,980 --> 00:07:00,460
Got it?

79
00:07:01,073 --> 00:07:01,980
Sapphire!

80
00:07:02,170 --> 00:07:03,448
They're still after us.

81
00:07:03,473 --> 00:07:03,905
Tink!

82
00:07:03,930 --> 00:07:04,930
Shut the door!

83
00:07:18,870 --> 00:07:19,540
Tink!

84
00:07:19,665 --> 00:07:21,680
Put something against that window too!

85
00:07:21,704 --> 00:07:22,497
Okay!

86
00:07:25,270 --> 00:07:26,540
That window, too!

87
00:07:47,035 --> 00:07:47,982
Oh no!

88
00:07:51,286 --> 00:07:52,286
It's dangerous if it breaks!

89
00:07:55,700 --> 00:07:56,700
No!

90
00:07:57,015 --> 00:07:58,233
It's not safe here!

91
00:08:03,520 --> 00:08:05,760
Everyone run while I fight it!

92
00:08:17,540 --> 00:08:18,840
I fell into a hole!

93
00:08:21,910 --> 00:08:22,822
Damn it!

94
00:08:23,180 --> 00:08:24,620
I fell through that old well!

95
00:08:24,911 --> 00:08:27,773
- Mom! Help! Moma!
- Help!

96
00:08:29,450 --> 00:08:30,450
What is that?

97
00:08:30,580 --> 00:08:31,580
A monster!

98
00:08:31,753 --> 00:08:32,933
Hurry, run!

99
00:08:33,269 --> 00:08:34,679
It's eating my shadow!

100
00:08:45,780 --> 00:08:46,306
No way!

101
00:08:46,331 --> 00:08:47,380
My shadow too!

102
00:08:47,490 --> 00:08:48,800
What a fascinating monster!

103
00:08:48,875 --> 00:08:51,840
The males eat the boys' shadows, and the females eat the girls'!

104
00:08:51,841 --> 00:08:52,160
Perfect!

105
00:08:52,184 --> 00:08:54,015
I'll set this monster on Prince Sapphire!

106
00:08:54,040 --> 00:08:55,100
This is getting interesting!

107
00:08:57,266 --> 00:08:58,266
It's coming this way!

108
00:08:58,340 --> 00:08:58,986
Run!

109
00:09:02,295 --> 00:09:04,899
My shadow tastes awful, you won't like it!

110
00:09:08,919 --> 00:09:10,200
Help me!

111
00:09:11,140 --> 00:09:12,140
Tink!

112
00:09:12,460 --> 00:09:13,840
Are you okay?

113
00:09:13,890 --> 00:09:14,620
Hey!

114
00:09:14,785 --> 00:09:15,785
Is anyone there...?

115
00:09:19,419 --> 00:09:20,419
Everyone!

116
00:09:20,785 --> 00:09:22,120
Are you alright?

117
00:09:22,250 --> 00:09:23,766
Tink!

118
00:09:24,069 --> 00:09:26,221
Tink it's the prince!

119
00:09:31,560 --> 00:09:32,560
Everyone!

120
00:09:32,660 --> 00:09:33,660
You're all safe!

121
00:09:33,900 --> 00:09:34,539
What a relief!

122
00:09:34,820 --> 00:09:37,680
I was worried after falling down here, but now I can relax!

123
00:09:40,339 --> 00:09:42,060
Looks like you ended up saving me instead!

124
00:09:42,500 --> 00:09:43,500
Thank you so much!

125
00:09:47,220 --> 00:09:48,220
What's wrong?

126
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:49,720
Why is everyone crying?

127
00:09:50,680 --> 00:09:51,179
Tink!

128
00:09:51,380 --> 00:09:52,640
What on earth happened?

129
00:09:53,299 --> 00:09:55,434
A monster ate our shadows...?

130
00:09:55,458 --> 00:09:56,453
What?!

131
00:09:59,039 --> 00:10:01,075
A shadow-eating monster...

132
00:10:01,512 --> 00:10:02,080
Ah, found it!

133
00:10:02,100 --> 00:10:03,100
This must be it!

134
00:10:03,205 --> 00:10:04,205
That's the one!

135
00:10:04,819 --> 00:10:08,360
This is a monster called Kagera. It's a creature that eats animals' shadows.

136
00:10:08,605 --> 00:10:11,183
It was originally a giant slug living in a pond...

137
00:10:11,207 --> 00:10:13,986
So, what happens to the children whose shadows were eaten?

138
00:10:14,260 --> 00:10:19,000
According to records, the same thing happened 500 years ago, and the children died the next day.

139
00:10:19,640 --> 00:10:20,361
Died?

140
00:10:20,686 --> 00:10:21,293
Doctor!

141
00:10:21,410 --> 00:10:22,660
Isn't there any way to save them?

142
00:10:22,920 --> 00:10:24,513
That's easier said than done.

143
00:10:25,100 --> 00:10:27,680
We've evacuated all the children in town to the basement.

144
00:10:39,969 --> 00:10:42,780
We must protect these children at all costs!

145
00:10:43,940 --> 00:10:45,999
The monster is here!

146
00:10:52,753 --> 00:10:53,400
Where?

147
00:10:53,520 --> 00:10:54,086
Over there!

148
00:10:54,185 --> 00:10:55,360
It's heading right for the town!

149
00:10:55,675 --> 00:10:56,675
There's no time!

150
00:10:56,699 --> 00:11:03,117
I hear the male monster attacks men, while the female attacks women.

151
00:11:04,307 --> 00:11:06,363
By the way, the one targeting Sapphire was the female Kagera...

152
00:11:06,387 --> 00:11:07,721
Wait, what?

153
00:11:07,763 --> 00:11:09,060
The female Kagera?!

154
00:11:27,720 --> 00:11:28,640
Wait!

155
00:11:29,030 --> 00:11:31,253
If we fire the cannons now, the town will be ruined!

156
00:11:31,705 --> 00:11:33,940
We have to think of another way!

157
00:11:34,545 --> 00:11:35,620
Another way?

158
00:11:36,180 --> 00:11:36,846
All right!

159
00:11:36,949 --> 00:11:40,880
I'll act as a decoy and lure that monster to the mountains!

160
00:11:41,639 --> 00:11:43,840
Prince, I'll accompany you!

161
00:11:44,115 --> 00:11:45,115
Follow me if you want!

162
00:11:46,489 --> 00:11:50,460
After all, I'm curious to see which Kagera targets Sapphire.

163
00:11:50,820 --> 00:11:51,820
What?

164
00:11:52,220 --> 00:11:56,100
The male Kagera targets boys, and the female targets girls.

165
00:11:56,230 --> 00:11:59,060
Now, which Kagera will go after Sapphire?

166
00:12:00,560 --> 00:12:02,126
Let's go, Lord Sapphire!

167
00:12:03,165 --> 00:12:03,880
What's wrong?

168
00:12:03,913 --> 00:12:05,080
Your Highness!

169
00:12:32,100 --> 00:12:32,860
Monster!

170
00:12:32,900 --> 00:12:33,746
Bring it here!

171
00:12:34,979 --> 00:12:36,073
What's going on?

172
00:12:36,154 --> 00:12:37,600
The male Kagera isn't following us.

173
00:12:46,729 --> 00:12:47,700
Are you still here?

174
00:12:47,750 --> 00:12:49,120
Come on, get on behind me, quick!

175
00:12:49,460 --> 00:12:51,160
Head up into the mountains!

176
00:12:53,180 --> 00:12:54,180
There it is!

177
00:12:55,520 --> 00:12:56,520
Help!

178
00:13:01,800 --> 00:13:02,340
Nylon!

179
00:13:02,670 --> 00:13:03,980
Don't run toward the castle!

180
00:13:05,431 --> 00:13:06,185
Wait!

181
00:13:06,255 --> 00:13:07,380
Kagera is heading for the castle!

182
00:13:15,360 --> 00:13:16,360
Kagera!

183
00:13:16,990 --> 00:13:18,553
You're fighting me, Sapphire!

184
00:13:33,374 --> 00:13:35,386
Damn that Prince Sapphire! He's completely cornered!

185
00:13:35,510 --> 00:13:36,140
Take that!

186
00:13:36,226 --> 00:13:37,260
Gobble him up!

187
00:13:37,285 --> 00:13:37,933
Too bad!

188
00:13:38,135 --> 00:13:40,153
Pull yourself together,
we're almost there Monster!

189
00:13:40,326 --> 00:13:40,740
Alright!

190
00:13:40,880 --> 00:13:41,879
Bite him right there!

191
00:13:43,420 --> 00:13:44,786
I want to save Sapphire!

192
00:14:02,119 --> 00:14:03,546
Raise the drawbridge!

193
00:14:20,900 --> 00:14:21,420
Tink!

194
00:14:21,695 --> 00:14:22,300
Are you okay?

195
00:14:22,580 --> 00:14:23,580
Hang in there!

196
00:14:23,895 --> 00:14:25,660
Everyone, we need to get close, fast!

197
00:14:25,760 --> 00:14:26,260
Come on, hurry!

198
00:14:26,745 --> 00:14:30,020
I promise I'll defeat the monster and get everyone's shadows back!

199
00:14:36,279 --> 00:14:37,060
It's so heavy!

200
00:14:37,180 --> 00:14:39,460
I've never held anything this heavy!

201
00:14:40,014 --> 00:14:41,106
Ouch!

202
00:14:41,131 --> 00:14:42,540
It hurts!

203
00:14:45,320 --> 00:14:46,960
My pinky hurts!

204
00:14:47,020 --> 00:14:48,720
The one that targeted Sapphire was the female Kagera!

205
00:14:48,721 --> 00:14:49,880
I knew it!

206
00:14:50,369 --> 00:14:51,800
A child is crying in the plaza!

207
00:14:51,880 --> 00:14:53,440
Leave them alone!

208
00:14:53,589 --> 00:14:54,940
But it's Lord Plastic!

209
00:14:54,941 --> 00:14:55,555
What?!

210
00:14:55,580 --> 00:14:56,580
My son?

211
00:14:56,620 --> 00:14:58,066
That crying sound...

212
00:14:58,190 --> 00:15:00,400
That really is my son, Plastic!

213
00:15:00,700 --> 00:15:03,040
Someone please save my son!

214
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:13,420
My shadow...

215
00:15:14,839 --> 00:15:16,140
What, what, what...?

216
00:15:16,589 --> 00:15:18,566
My shadow is gone...

217
00:15:19,986 --> 00:15:22,926
Plastic's shadow was taken!

218
00:15:36,320 --> 00:15:38,940
Plastic, come over here quickly!

219
00:15:39,140 --> 00:15:40,620
 fell asleep!

220
00:15:42,340 --> 00:15:43,340
My son!

221
00:15:43,639 --> 00:15:44,639
My son!

222
00:15:47,171 --> 00:15:48,926
My son, are you okay?

223
00:15:57,329 --> 00:15:58,619
What happened, Duralumin?

224
00:15:58,685 --> 00:16:00,580
My son was targeted too.

225
00:16:01,075 --> 00:16:02,075
What happened to Kagera?

226
00:16:03,139 --> 00:16:05,080
They're sleeping over there.

227
00:16:06,429 --> 00:16:08,980
Since the sun went away and shadows disappeared, they're taking a rest.

228
00:16:09,869 --> 00:16:10,869
All right, now's our chance!

229
00:16:13,560 --> 00:16:14,873
Oh, Lord Sapphire.

230
00:16:14,950 --> 00:16:17,440
Doctor, did you find a way to get the shadows back?

231
00:16:17,575 --> 00:16:21,918
Well, there is a way, but it's terrible. It's completely out of the question—

232
00:16:21,942 --> 00:16:23,000
 I don't care what it is!

233
00:16:23,180 --> 00:16:24,180
Tell us, Doctor!

234
00:16:24,469 --> 00:16:29,100
Well, basically... it seems that if we defeat the Kagera, our shadows will return.

235
00:16:29,295 --> 00:16:32,220
They say only a demon can defeat Kagera.

236
00:16:32,585 --> 00:16:33,300
A demon?

237
00:16:33,480 --> 00:16:38,660
Yes, to defeat Kagera, offer what the demon wants most as a sacrifice.

238
00:16:38,955 --> 00:16:41,540
Then the demon will get rid of Kagera for us.

239
00:16:41,705 --> 00:16:43,040
That's what it says in this book.

240
00:16:43,465 --> 00:16:45,180
What the demon wants most?

241
00:17:06,319 --> 00:17:06,973
Demon King!

242
00:17:07,334 --> 00:17:09,113
Mephisto, King of Demons!

243
00:17:09,464 --> 00:17:10,658
Sapphire calls for you!

244
00:17:10,819 --> 00:17:11,819
Come out!

245
00:17:12,160 --> 00:17:13,020
Mephisto!

246
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:14,160
Answer me!

247
00:17:14,579 --> 00:17:16,066
Sapphire has come for you!

248
00:17:16,744 --> 00:17:18,119
Welcome, Sapphire!

249
00:17:18,644 --> 00:17:19,819
Follow the torch!

250
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:20,960
I will hear what you have to say.

251
00:17:29,109 --> 00:17:30,780
So, you have a favor to ask of me.

252
00:17:31,050 --> 00:17:32,140
Name it.

253
00:17:32,939 --> 00:17:35,860
There is nothing in this world Demon King Mephisto cannot do.

254
00:17:36,215 --> 00:17:39,880
Though the heavens burn and the earth splits, we demons shall never perish.

255
00:17:40,340 --> 00:17:42,580
As long as Demon King Mephisto exists, we are eternal.

256
00:17:43,219 --> 00:17:46,560
Prince Sapphire, out with this favor of yours!

257
00:17:47,059 --> 00:17:48,846
I want you to defeat the monster Kagera!

258
00:17:48,914 --> 00:17:49,453
What?

259
00:17:49,560 --> 00:17:50,560
Kagera?

260
00:17:51,840 --> 00:17:55,360
It seems even Sapphire is having trouble with that monster.

261
00:17:55,804 --> 00:17:57,100
All right, easy enough.

262
00:17:57,579 --> 00:18:01,247
However, Sapphire, I'll defeat it, but in return...

263
00:18:01,271 --> 00:18:02,000
I know.

264
00:18:02,429 --> 00:18:05,520
I'll give you my boy's heart that you want so badly.

265
00:18:06,459 --> 00:18:08,020
Spoken like a true prince.

266
00:18:08,185 --> 00:18:09,720
You're quite reasonable.

267
00:18:10,920 --> 00:18:11,355
Hecate!

268
00:18:11,380 --> 00:18:12,980
Go and defeat Kagera!

269
00:18:13,119 --> 00:18:15,800
And bring back Sapphire's boy's heart on your way back!

270
00:18:22,369 --> 00:18:25,820
I already have a pretty good idea that Sapphire is a woman!

271
00:18:25,915 --> 00:18:28,440
Look what happened while you were dilly-dallying!

272
00:18:28,600 --> 00:18:29,913
What are you going to do about this?!

273
00:18:30,760 --> 00:18:31,300
Giant monsters!

274
00:18:31,466 --> 00:18:32,966
The sun is coming out again!

275
00:18:33,220 --> 00:18:34,940
The monsters have awakened!

276
00:18:41,519 --> 00:18:44,466
You useless, brainless fool!

277
00:18:44,554 --> 00:18:45,726
That's right, that's right!

278
00:18:45,795 --> 00:18:48,720
B-Behind... Behind you! Look!

279
00:18:49,120 --> 00:18:49,715
Shut up!

280
00:18:49,740 --> 00:18:51,760
Can't you see I'm furious?!

281
00:18:55,439 --> 00:18:58,980
As long as our shadows don't show, it won't chase us!

282
00:19:11,500 --> 00:19:12,100
Sapphire!

283
00:19:12,319 --> 00:19:13,820
Lure Kagera out from behind!

284
00:19:14,240 --> 00:19:14,780
Hey!

285
00:19:14,840 --> 00:19:17,020
Slowpoke monster Kagera, come get us!

286
00:19:17,021 --> 00:19:18,946
Catch us if you can!

287
00:19:19,050 --> 00:19:19,680
Here it comes!

288
00:19:19,681 --> 00:19:20,681
Leave it to me!

289
00:19:20,780 --> 00:19:21,260
Here goes!

290
00:19:21,340 --> 00:19:22,340
Look!

291
00:19:22,789 --> 00:19:24,113
What do we do now?

292
00:19:24,605 --> 00:19:25,605
Get off your horse!

293
00:19:26,300 --> 00:19:27,300
Right!

294
00:19:32,589 --> 00:19:34,540
Our shadows are getting so heavy...

295
00:19:39,559 --> 00:19:41,679
Let me quietly back away from here...

296
00:19:43,694 --> 00:19:45,753
I can't believe my shadow stayed behind...

297
00:19:47,859 --> 00:19:49,060
It's about to get interesting!

298
00:19:49,100 --> 00:19:49,760
Watch!

299
00:19:49,994 --> 00:19:51,300
Zuborasha!

300
00:19:56,879 --> 00:19:58,240
Borasha!

301
00:19:59,029 --> 00:20:03,160
Sora, Haora, Paora, Zuborasha!

302
00:20:04,115 --> 00:20:05,115
What are you doing?

303
00:20:05,374 --> 00:20:06,480
You'll see soon enough!

304
00:20:06,914 --> 00:20:08,280
Zuborasha!

305
00:20:08,475 --> 00:20:10,120
Zuborasha!

306
00:20:11,980 --> 00:20:12,640
It's sweet!

307
00:20:12,919 --> 00:20:14,300
Isn't this sugar water?

308
00:20:14,599 --> 00:20:16,313
What good is making sugar water?

309
00:20:17,319 --> 00:20:18,380
Zuborasha!

310
00:20:18,689 --> 00:20:21,560
Paint the sugar water onto Kagera's shadow with that brush!

311
00:20:27,989 --> 00:20:29,449
What's sugar water going to do?

312
00:20:43,720 --> 00:20:44,413
Hecate!

313
00:20:44,719 --> 00:20:45,600
Finished painting!

314
00:20:50,229 --> 00:20:51,700
Now to finally defeat it!

315
00:20:51,920 --> 00:20:52,335
Watch this!

316
00:20:52,360 --> 00:20:53,440
Zuborasha!

317
00:21:00,680 --> 00:21:01,293
It worked!

318
00:21:01,318 --> 00:21:02,640
It started eating the shadow!

319
00:21:03,090 --> 00:21:04,090
No way!

320
00:21:04,114 --> 00:21:05,500
They don't even realize it's their own shadow!

321
00:21:16,960 --> 00:21:17,600
Listen carefully.

322
00:21:17,789 --> 00:21:20,640
Now, that sugar water is about to turn into salt water!

323
00:21:41,229 --> 00:21:44,120
Kamera is a slug monster, so salt will melt it!

324
00:21:55,807 --> 00:22:03,518
My shadow is back! Hooray!
Hooray! How wonderful!

325
00:22:05,960 --> 00:22:06,960
Your shadow is back!

326
00:22:06,989 --> 00:22:08,435
Plastic is saved!

327
00:22:08,460 --> 00:22:09,460
He's saved!

328
00:22:09,906 --> 00:22:10,620
What a relief!

329
00:22:10,644 --> 00:22:11,840
Thank goodness!

330
00:22:12,840 --> 00:22:14,514
Lord Plastic was saved!

331
00:22:14,539 --> 00:22:15,539
He was saved!

332
00:22:21,339 --> 00:22:24,480
Now, Hecate, take my heart as promised!

333
00:22:24,760 --> 00:22:25,760
I can't get close to you!

334
00:22:25,874 --> 00:22:27,020
Zuborasha!

335
00:22:30,849 --> 00:22:32,260
Get on this and come with me!

336
00:22:36,359 --> 00:22:37,679
Sapphire!

337
00:22:38,829 --> 00:22:39,829
That's a demon!

338
00:22:40,014 --> 00:22:41,480
A demon took Sapphire!

339
00:22:48,839 --> 00:22:51,620
I've been looking forward to this day!

340
00:22:52,240 --> 00:22:52,880
Sapphire!

341
00:22:52,905 --> 00:22:54,000
Surrender!

342
00:22:54,720 --> 00:22:55,720
Mephisto!

343
00:22:55,820 --> 00:22:56,266
Stop!

344
00:22:56,500 --> 00:22:56,906
Oh!

345
00:22:57,140 --> 00:22:57,660
An angel!

346
00:22:57,840 --> 00:22:58,240
It's night!

347
00:22:58,360 --> 00:22:58,753
Stay back!

348
00:22:58,840 --> 00:22:59,840
Get away!

349
00:22:59,919 --> 00:23:02,000
You can't take Sapphire's heart!

350
00:23:02,820 --> 00:23:03,720
What are you talking about?!

351
00:23:03,766 --> 00:23:05,300
We defeated Kagira!

352
00:23:05,514 --> 00:23:07,540
Taking Sapphire's heart is only right!

353
00:23:07,999 --> 00:23:11,000
I'll give you my heart instead of Sapphire's!

354
00:23:11,070 --> 00:23:12,070
You can take it!

355
00:23:12,113 --> 00:23:13,815
Come on, hurry!

356
00:23:13,840 --> 00:23:14,460
Get away from me!

357
00:23:14,500 --> 00:23:15,500
My body is going numb!

358
00:23:15,530 --> 00:23:16,530
Hecate, run!

359
00:23:16,700 --> 00:23:17,700
You'll pay for this!

360
00:23:19,259 --> 00:23:20,740
Sapphire, I'm so glad!

361
00:23:21,149 --> 00:23:22,560
I'm fine just as I am!

362
00:23:23,134 --> 00:23:24,460
We both made it out safe!

363
00:23:24,709 --> 00:23:26,520
Well then, bye!

364
00:23:31,699 --> 00:23:32,614
Hecate...

365
00:23:33,858 --> 00:23:35,607
goodbye!

